{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "虚拟化几何冒烟证据 schema(G5.2-C+G5.3-C,步骤 84;G-G5-5;RFC-0016 章 C)",
  "description": "ci/renderer_visbuffer_smoke.py 写 evidence/renderer_visbuffer_smoke_<ts>.json。host 段恒跑几何参考器；device 段按能力分波 gate real：W1 cull/classify-resolve 与 W2 u64 VisBuffer 经 Vulkan 真派发并与 host 金标准对拍；无 loader 可 dev-env-degrade，RURIX_REQUIRE_REAL=1 翻硬红。",
